ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh053: OPEN_SHELL with one ADVANCED_FACE on a PLANE (z=0, normal +Z); FACE_OUTER_BOUND references an EDGE_LOOP with empty edge list EDGE_LOOP('',()); empty EDGE_LOOP IS wired into face boundary topology; merge step must validate input before running; construction error raised when merge walker finds zero edges to iterate */
